Today is Wednesday.
I come home from the office in the evening.
My neighbour Asha is in the building's lobby.
We always meet each other here.
"Namaste Maya, how are you?" Asha asks.
"I am absolutely fine," I say.
"Maya, are you free this Saturday?" she asks.
"Yes, Saturday is my day off," I reply.
"We sometimes drink tea together," Asha says.
"Shall we go out for coffee this time?"
"Yes, this is a very good idea!" I say.
"At what time do we meet?" I ask.
"Is morning at eleven o'clock okay?" Asha asks.
Saturday is not far now.
"Yes, eleven o'clock is absolutely fine," I say.
"Okay, we meet on Saturday," Asha says.
I smile and go into my flat.
